# Learn: a fresh profile's Play opens lesson 1 (First Lift); three flaps on
# Space clear it, Next lesson runs lesson 2 (Hold the Line: six seconds
# aloft) and lesson 3 (Thread the Gate: three gates), each flown by the
# rules bot's plan (`node tools/plan.mjs learn-N`: the round waits for the
# first flap and then counts one tick a frame, so the planned score is the
# score), through the results with their breakdown.
until 300 Play
frames 200
save title
click Play
until 60 First Lift
frames 10
save setup
expect flap 3 times
click Start
